Alias 	MyLamc	Lambda_c+
Alias	MyLamcb	anti-Lambda_c-

Decay pbarpSystem
  0.5 MyLamc anti-Lambda_c- 	PHSP;
  0.5 Lambda_c+ MyLamcb  		PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay pbarpSystem0
  0.5 MyLamc anti-Lambda_c- 	PHSP;
  0.5 Lambda_c+ MyLamcb  		PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay MyLamc
  1.0  p+ K- pi+		PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay MyLamcb
  1.0 anti-p- K+ pi-	PHSP;
Enddecay

End
